==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|правьда}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*pravьda}}, derived from {{cog|sla-pro|*pravъ}} (compare {{m|ru|пра́вый}}) plus an unclear suffix. 

Cognate with {{cog|uk|пра́вда||[[truth]]}}, {{cog|be|пра́ўда||[[truth]]}}, {{cog|cu|правьда||[[justice]], [[truth]]}}, {{cog|bg|пра́вда||[[justice]], [[truth]], [[livestock]] [[capital]]}}, {{cog|sh|пра̑вда||[[justice]], [[truth]], [[controversial]] [[matter]]}}, {{cog|sl|prȃvda||[[regulation]], [[law]], [[court]] [[case]]}}, {{cog|cs|pravda||[[truth]]}}, {{cog|sk|pravda||[[truth]]}}, {{cog|pl|prawda||[[truth]]}}, {{cog|hsb|prawda||[[truth]]}}, {{cog|dsb|pšawda||[[truth]]}}. Compare derived adjective {{m|ru|пра́ведный}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|пра́вда}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-правда.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Lvova-правда.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|пра́вда|adj=правди́вый}}

# [[truth]] {{gl|conformity to fact or reality; true facts}}
#: {{syn|ru|и́стина}}
#: {{ant|ru|ложь|непра́вда|кри́вда|q3=poetic}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в|В]] «'''Пра́вде'''» [[нет]] [[известие|изве́стий]], [[а]] [[в]] «[[Известия|Изве́стиях]]» [[нет]] '''пра́вды'''.|In ''Pravda'' there is no news, and in ''Izvestia'' there is no '''truth'''. (a familiar pun)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[по|По]] '''пра́вде''' [[сказа́ть]], [[я]] [[случа́йно]] [[за]] [[су́тки]] [[не]] [[принять|при́нял]] [[лекарство|лека́рства]].|To tell (you) the '''truth''', I accidentally didn't take my medicine for 24 hours.}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''Пра́вда'''?|Really?}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[ну|Ну]] '''пра́вда''' [[же]]?|Am I right? (seeking confirmation)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[по]] '''пра́вде''' [[говорить|говоря́]]|to tell '''the truth'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[твоя|Твоя́]] '''пра́вда'''.|[[you're right|You're right]]. / [[fair play|Fair play]]. / [[you win|You win]].}}
# [[justice]]
#: {{syn|ru|справедли́вость}}
# {{lb|ru|historical}} [[law]], [[code]]
#: {{uxi|ru|Сали́ческая '''пра́вда'''|[[Salic law|Salic '''law''']]}}

